        "section": "2-bytes",
        "anchor": [
          560,
          2490.5,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "FP4 latent, 2x token compression, only 4 of 38 compressed layers own KV, 128-token blocks;\nplus a fixed 3,128,928 B per sequence of sliding-window state, about 3,504 B per token at an\n893-token turn. From its config and a production engine's code, not run here",
      "originalText": "FP4 latent, 2x token compression, only 4 of 38 compressed layers own KV, 128-token blocks;\nplus a fixed 3,128,928 B per sequence of sliding-window state, about 3,504 B per token at an\n893-token turn. From its config and a production engine's code, not run here",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
