      "customData": {
        "section": "8-cost",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          10234.5,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "Reserving max_tokens leaves 762.8 MiB of reservations empty; with blocks only the ends of 41 last blocks, 7.2 MiB, sit\nempty, and the tokens and logits stay those of the contiguous cache. Blocks give up one guarantee. A reply that runs\nlonger can find the pool empty halfway, and then a request has to wait or be evicted; a full reservation never runs out.",
      "originalText": "Reserving max_tokens leaves 762.8 MiB of reservations empty; with blocks only the ends of 41 last blocks, 7.2 MiB, sit\nempty, and the tokens and logits stay those of the contiguous cache. Blocks give up one guarantee. A reply that runs\nlonger can find the pool empty halfway, and then a request has to wait or be evicted; a full reservation never runs out.",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
