      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "8-cost",
        "anchor": [
          1640,
          10784.5,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "this Mac times nothing here: we gather each\ngroup's blocks into one tensor at every layer,\na GPU kernel reads them in place",
      "originalText": "this Mac times nothing here: we gather each\ngroup's blocks into one tensor at every layer,\na GPU kernel reads them in place",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bVF"
    },
    {
      "id": "8-cost-2000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11224.5,
      "width": 1731.6000000000001,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 430095518,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1981607021,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794883834837,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "8-cost",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          11224.5,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "Each sequence wastes the unused end of its last block, about half a block: nothing at block 1, 3,177.6 KiB per\nsequence at block 256. Smaller blocks pay in lookups instead, one table entry and one short, scattered read per\nblock (1,148 of them for the longest turn at block 1, 72 at block 16), plus more ids for the pool to track.",
      "originalText": "Each sequence wastes the unused end of its last block, about half a block: nothing at block 1, 3,177.6 KiB per\nsequence at block 256. Smaller blocks pay in lookups instead, one table entry and one short, scattered read per\nblock (1,148 of them for the longest turn at block 1, 72 at block 16), plus more ids for the pool to track.",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bVG"
    },
